title Vinyl P2a: the sleep timer running (30 minutes chosen 48 s ago: "Stops in 29:12", the music fading over the last 10 s), the Sleep timer page with its status line and the Menu with the time left (the qa sizes and 1280x720)
sizes 800x480 480x480 720x720 480x800 480x640 1280x720
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_PAGE sleep
env VINYL_DEMO_SLEEP 30
env VINYL_DEMO_SLEEP_LEFT 1753

wait 900
shot 01-sleep-running
expect text "30 minutes"
expect text "STOP PLAYING AFTER"
key left
wait 400
shot 02-menu-running
expect text "Sleep timer"
key left
wait 400
shot 03-now-running
expect noquit
